---
import LegalView from '../../views/LegalView.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../config';
---
<LegalView lang="en" page="privacy" title="Privacy policy" description="Privacy policy of Zürich Food under the Swiss Federal Act on Data Protection (FADP).">
  <p><em>Template, please have it legally reviewed before launch.</em></p>
  <h2>Controller</h2>
  <p>Laura Wick &amp; Eva Wick, Zürich Food, <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. This policy follows the Swiss Federal Act on Data Protection (FADP).</p>
  <h2>No cookies, no tracking</h2>
  <p>This website sets no cookies and uses no analytics or advertising tools. Fonts are served locally; no data is sent to Google Fonts.</p>
  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>The website is hosted on GitHub Pages (GitHub Inc., USA). The host processes technically necessary data such as IP address, date and requested page in server logs.</p>
  <h2>Map</h2>
  <p>The map uses tiles from OpenStreetMap. When the map loads, your IP address is sent to the OpenStreetMap Foundation. The map only loads on the map page.</p>
  <h2>Contact form and email</h2>
  <p>If you contact us, we use your details solely to handle your request and delete them when no longer needed.</p>
  <h2>Newsletter</h2>
  <p>For the newsletter we store your email address with our mailing provider [add provider]. You can unsubscribe at any time via the link in every issue.</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You have the right to access, correct and delete your data. Write to us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>
</LegalView>
